##     # ---- CGRA datapath: N-cycle multicycle path (N = step_div) ----------
##     # The controller issues 'step' once every G_STEP_DIV clocks (cgra_ctrl.vhd
##     # S_RUN), so every PE result register (u_pe/r_reg) captures at most once
